  narrativeMessages:
  - "It\u2019s darker in here... we never liked rooms like this when we were kids."
  - My brother always found a way to make the dark feel less frightening.
  - Now all I can feel is how empty it is without him.
  objectiveMessage: Look around for anything unusual.
  letterDelay: 0.06
  delayBetweenMessages: 1
  stayAfterNarrative: 1.5
  objectiveStayTime: 3
